&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#201;cole&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Transmutation.html&quot; title=&quot;Transmutation&quot;&gt;Transmutation&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;b&gt;Niveau&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Barde.html&quot; title=&quot;Le barde&quot;&gt;Bard&lt;/a&gt; 6  
